  "description": "Efficiency goes a long way when you’re going a long way. Spearfish is our carbon endurance and XC bike designed for the toughest singletrack events on Earth. It all starts with our new Deluxe carbon construction, shaving more than 250 grams off our standard carbon with no compromise in ride quality, stiffness, or durability. Paired with 120mm of Split Pivot rear suspension travel, Spearfish offers awesome pedaling efficiency and traction. A 120mm RockShox SID Ultimate Flight Attendant fork smooths out even the roughest sections of singletrack.\n\nEquip yourself for anything with Spearfish’s on-bike cargo mounts: carry two bottles (or up to three on MD–XL frames), a multitool, and tube, and use the top tube mounts for our EXP-R Series Trillium Top Tube Bag or a K-Edge computer mount. SRAM’s X0 Transmission drivetrain delivers precisions shifts in a blip while the WTB CZR Trail carbon wheels cut rotational weight to save you precious energy.\n\nOne ride on Spearfish C DLX X0 Transmission and you’ll see why it’s the best XC mountain bike when every ounce of effort and endurance matters.",
